# Support Agent Workflow (Concrete)

## Working Directories
- Backend: `crm-deployment/`
- Frontend: `frappe-bench/apps/crm/frontend/`
- Chatbot: `assistant/executive-ai-assistant-main/farfalle-main/`

## Standard Steps
1) Read scope
   - Identify target files (e.g., `crm/api/email.py`, `frontend/src/...`)
2) Implement
   - Make minimal edits; preserve formatting
   - Add new files under appropriate folders as specified in the task
3) Validate
   - For Python: run unit tests if present; else `flake8` style conformance (document if not available)
   - For Vue: ensure build compiles (document commands but do not run automatically)
4) Deliver
   - Provide a short summary and a diff-like snippet showing exact changes

## Commands (document for humans)
- Python tests: `pytest crm-deployment/tests -v` (if tests are created in task)
- Curl example: `curl -s https://<site>/api/method/crm.api.email.send -d '{"communication_name":"..."}'`

## Guardrails
- Do not introduce new public endpoints; use existing whitelisted API
- No migrations/schema changes unless explicitly instructed
- Keep unrelated changes out of diffs; small, reviewable edits only

## Handoff
- Output includes: modified file paths, rationale, test notes, and next steps